# Origin of the live-game Worker (see wrangler.jsonc). Leave unset for local
# development: `npm run dev` proxies /api to the Worker on port 8787.
# In production the static site and the game server are on different origins.
#
# This is baked into the bundle at BUILD time, so it must be set wherever the
# site is built (locally, or in the GitHub Pages workflow) — not at runtime.
#
# The Worker side has a matching setting: ALLOWED_ORIGINS in wrangler.jsonc must
# name the site's origin (e.g. https://YOU.github.io), or any page on the web
# can drive your game server from a browser.
VITE_LIVE_SERVER_URL=https://free-chess-training-live.YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev
